OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn footage released earlier by the
OL,8,FKremlin of him leaving the talks, Putin
OL,9,Fsays to Xi: "I don't think anyone even
OL,10,Fexpected everything to go so well"
OL,12,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,13,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,14,Fthe Russian leader his friend - watch
OL,15,Fthe moment here
OL,17,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,18,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,19,Fwar
